+  // target process cannot reopen.  In those recovery cases, unlink and retry
+  // without O_TRUNC: some /sdcard FUSE/MediaProvider paths report EEXIST when
+  // creating with truncation, while a plain create succeeds and is later resized
+  // by the normal write/ftruncate path below.
